Gelin Example - User Input in Soplang
---------------------------------
Note: For automated testing, we'll simulate user input with a hardcoded value
(Normally this would be: door magac = gelin('Enter your name: '))
Hello, Soplang User!
Welcome to Soplang programming!
The type of your input is: qoraal
Your name has 12 characters.
Thank you for trying gelin in Soplang!
